    "text": "By Srishti Chourasia ,\n49 minutes ago Two weeks into her marriage to Colin Dooley, Baylen Dupree is getting candid about the emotional wedding day highs, and teasing that a huge last-minute change nearly upended the whole affair. Baylen Out Loud star Baylen Dupree reflected on the ceremony during an appearance at the Gracie Awards in Beverly Hills on May 19, revealing that in the months leading up to the big day, not everything went according to plan. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
